# Fingerprint HAL — Meizu MX6 (m95), LineageOS 18.1.
#
# Service name and HIDL instance are unchanged from the LineageOS module this
# is derived from: goodixfpd.rc restarts "vendor.fps_hal" once the daemon is
# up, and hwservicemanager starts this interface lazily when FingerprintService
# first asks for it (seen on 18.1 as "Since ...IBiometricsFingerprint/default
# is not registered, trying to start it as a lazy HAL").
#
# class late_start, not hal: upstream's comment about a /data race applies here
# too, and this HAL is useless before goodixfingerprintd (class main) exists.
#
# group: system input uhid as upstream, plus nothing else — /dev/goodix_fp is
# owned by the daemon, not by this process.
#
# LAZY, NOT AUTOSTARTED (2026-09-07). "disabled" is kept deliberately, and it
# is not a leftover of the crash-loop lockdown: with the "interface" line
# present hwservicemanager starts this service the moment FingerprintService
# asks for IBiometricsFingerprint/default, which happens well after
# goodixfingerprintd (class main) is up. That removes the openHal() race the
# goodixfpd.rc self-heal stanza existed for, and it keeps a regression in the
# blob from turning into a boot-time crash loop: the process can only be
# started by a framework request or by hand.
#
# The crash this replaced: /vendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.default.so died inside
# its own open() every 5 s —
#   signal 11 (SIGSEGV), fault addr 0x0, uid 1000
#   #00 fingerprint.default.so (getService()+416)   <- ldr x0,[x22], x22 == 0
#   #01 fingerprint.default.so (open+...)
#   #02 ...m95 (BiometricsFingerprint::openHal()+144)
# — because libgoodixfingerprintd_binder.so builds android::Parcel objects on
# the stack with Nougat's sizeof(Parcel) == 104 while R's is 120.
# tools/blobpatch/goodix_binder_parcel_frames.py widens those 43 frames; see
# A11_BRINGUP_STATE.md §2s for the per-function proof that the Parcel is the
# topmost sp-relative object in every one of them.
service vendor.fps_hal /vendor/bin/hw/android.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.0-service.m95
    interface android.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.1::IBiometricsFingerprint default
    class late_start
    disabled
    user system
    group system input uhid
    writepid /dev/cpuset/system-background/tasks
